Test: substr() function
--------------------------------------
  Original string: Hello World
  substr(s, 1, 5): Hello
  substr(s, 7): World
  substr(s, 1, 11): Hello World
  substr(s, 7, 5): World

  Edge cases:
  substr("abc", 1, 0): 
  substr("abc", 2, 10): bc
  substr("abc", 10, 5): 
  substr("", 1, 1): 
